# Repository Structure

```text
rubiks-cube-assistant/
│
├── config/                 # Camera, colour, database, and remote configuration
├── src/
│   ├── cube_assistant/     # Integrated team scanner, workflow, solver, and storage
│   └── vision/             # Backwards-compatible team scanner launcher
├── docs/                   # Architecture, testing, setup, and evidence notes
├── scripts/                # Laptop, Pi, solver, launch, and quality-check scripts
├── test-data/              # Synthetic fixture definitions
├── tests/                  # Scanner, unit, integration, persistence, and API tests
├── web/                    # PHP/MySQL API and dashboard
├── README.md
├── pyproject.toml
├── requirements.txt
└── .gitignore
```

